<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rate rise to 2.86 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rate rise to 2.86 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar rose slightly to 2.86 percent on Monday from 2.78 percent on Sunday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>The Central Bank said seven banks traded on the market in 23 reported transactions with a total value of 32.25 million dinars ($45.6 million).</p>
<p>$1 = 0.7080 dinar</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
